<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>MineralsReady — Minerals Compliance &amp; Training Platform</title>
<meta name="description" content="MineralsReady is a government-led digital public service for responsible artisanal and small-scale mining: a field app for training, verification and self-reporting, paired with a regulator dashboard for oversight.">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'%3E%3Crect width='32' height='32' rx='7' fill='%230a0e14'/%3E%3Cpath d='M16 6L25 12V20L16 26L7 20V12L16 6Z' fill='none' stroke='%23f5a623' stroke-width='1.6'/%3E%3Cpath d='M16 14L20.5 16.5V21.5L16 24L11.5 21.5V16.5L16 14Z' fill='%2335d0ba'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#0a0e14;
    --bg-raised:#10161f;
    --bg-soft:#161d29;
    --bg-card:#121923;
    --ink:#eef1f6;
    --ink-soft:#8e97a8;
    --ink-faint:#5c6577;
    --accent:#f5a623;
    --accent-dim:#8a6220;
    --verify:#35d0ba;
    --verify-dim:#1f5e54;
    --rule:rgba(238,241,246,0.10);
    --rule-strong:rgba(238,241,246,0.18);
    --shadow:rgba(0,0,0,0.55);
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Inter',system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;
    font-size:16px;
    line-height:1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  img,svg{max-width:100%;display:block;}
  a{color:inherit;}

  .label{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;
    font-size:0.68rem;
    letter-spacing:0.16em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--accent);
  }
  h1,h2,h3{
    font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;
    font-weight:600;
    margin:0;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    text-wrap:balance;
  }
  .wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,4vw,56px);}

  /* ---------- NAV ---------- */
  nav{
    position:sticky;top:0;z-index:40;
    background:rgba(10,14,20,0.86);
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  nav .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:72px;}
  .brandmark{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:1.1rem;letter-spacing:-0.01em;}
  .brandmark svg{width:24px;height:24px;flex:none;}
  .brandmark .ready{color:var(--accent);}
  nav ul{list-style:none;display:flex;gap:30px;margin:0;padding:0;}
  nav ul a{font-size:0.86rem;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink-soft);transition:color .15s ease;}
  nav ul a:hover,nav a:focus-visible{color:var(--accent);}
  .navlinks{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:30px;}
  @media (max-width:860px){ .navlinks ul{display:none;} }
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:0.72rem;letter-spacing:0.07em;text-transform:uppercase;
    padding:11px 20px;border-radius:3px;text-decoration:none;
    border:1px solid var(--rule-strong);color:var(--ink);background:none;appearance:none;cursor:pointer;
    transition:border-color .15s ease,background .15s ease,color .15s ease;
  }
  .btn:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent);}
  .btn-solid{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:#1a1304;}
  .btn-solid:hover{background:#ffc04d;border-color:#ffc04d;color:#1a1304;}

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero{position:relative;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);overflow:hidden;}
  .hero::before{
    content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;
    background:radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 50% at 80% 0%, rgba(245,166,35,0.12), transparent 60%),
               radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 40% at 10% 100%, rgba(53,208,186,0.08), transparent 60%);
  }
  .hero .wrap{
    position:relative;z-index:1;
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr 0.95fr;gap:48px;align-items:center;
    padding-top:clamp(52px,7vw,96px);padding-bottom:clamp(52px,7vw,96px);
  }
  @media (max-width:900px){ .hero .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;} .hero-art{order:-1;} }
  .hero-eyebrow{margin-bottom:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}
  .hero-eyebrow .rule{width:30px;height:1px;background:var(--accent);}
  .hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,5vw,3.9rem);line-height:1.04;}
  .hero h1 .accentword{color:var(--accent);}
  .hero p.lede{margin-top:22px;max-width:50ch;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:1.07rem;}
  .hero-ctas{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .hero-note{margin-top:24px;font-size:0.82rem;color:var(--ink-faint);}
  .hero-art{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;}
  .hero-art svg{width:100%;max-width:420px;}

  /* ---------- STATS STRIP ---------- */
  .ledger{border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);background:var(--bg-raised);}
  .ledger .wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);}
  .ledger-item{padding:26px clamp(16px,2.4vw,30px);border-right:1px solid var(--rule);}
  .ledger-item:last-child{border-right:none;}
  .ledger-item .num{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:1.3rem;color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;}
  .ledger-item p{margin:8px 0 0;font-size:0.84rem;color:var(--ink-soft);}
  @media (max-width:860px){ .ledger .wrap{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);} }
  @media (max-width:520px){ .ledger .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;} .ledger-item{border-right:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);} .ledger-item:last-child{border-bottom:none;} }

  /* ---------- SECTION SHELL ---------- */
  section{padding:clamp(56px,8vw,104px) 0;}
  .section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:30px;margin-bottom:clamp(32px,5vw,52px);flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .section-head h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3.1vw,2.5rem);}
  .section-head .label{white-space:nowrap;}
  .section-intro{color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:66ch;font-size:1rem;margin:-18px 0 40px;}
  .alt{background:var(--bg-raised);border-top:1px solid var(--rule);border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);}

  /* ---------- TWO SURFACES ---------- */
  .surfaces{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;background:var(--rule);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;}
  @media (max-width:760px){ .surfaces{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .surface{background:var(--bg-card);padding:clamp(28px,3.4vw,40px);}
  .surface .label{display:block;margin-bottom:14px;}
  .surface h3{font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:10px;}
  .surface > p{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:0.95rem;max-width:42ch;margin-bottom:24px;}
  .surface.dash .label{color:var(--verify);}
  .featlist{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;}
  .featlist li{display:flex;gap:12px;font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--ink-soft);align-items:flex-start;}
  .featlist li b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;}
  .tick{flex:none;width:18px;height:18px;margin-top:2px;}
  .surface .tick{color:var(--accent);}
  .surface.dash .tick{color:var(--verify);}
  .seam-note{margin-top:26px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--ink-faint);}

  /* ---------- REASONS GRID ---------- */
  .reasons{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--rule);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;}
  @media (max-width:860px){ .reasons{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);} }
  @media (max-width:560px){ .reasons{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .reason{background:var(--bg-card);padding:24px 22px;}
  .reason .idx{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--accent);}
  .reason h4{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:1.02rem;font-weight:600;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink);}
  .reason p{margin:0;font-size:0.86rem;color:var(--ink-soft);}

  /* ---------- CURRICULUM ---------- */
  .modgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--rule);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;}
  @media (max-width:900px){ .modgrid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);} }
  @media (max-width:520px){ .modgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .mod{background:var(--bg-card);padding:22px 20px;}
  .mod .glyph{
    width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:7px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--rule-strong);margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .mod .glyph svg{width:17px;height:17px;color:var(--accent);}
  .mod h4{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:0.98rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px;}
  .mod p{margin:0;font-size:0.82rem;color:var(--ink-soft);}

  /* ---------- PHASES ---------- */
  .phases{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;counter-reset:step;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--rule);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;}
  @media (max-width:900px){ .phases{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);} }
  @media (max-width:560px){ .phases{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .phases li{counter-increment:step;background:var(--bg-card);padding:24px 20px;position:relative;}
  .phases li::before{
    content:counter(step,decimal-leading-zero);
    display:block;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--verify);margin-bottom:12px;
  }
  .phases .when{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:0.68rem;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:var(--ink-faint);text-transform:uppercase;display:block;margin-bottom:6px;}
  .phases h4{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px;}
  .phases p{margin:0;font-size:0.84rem;color:var(--ink-soft);}

  /* ---------- GOVERNANCE ---------- */
  .govgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--rule);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;}
  @media (max-width:760px){ .govgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .gov{background:var(--bg-card);padding:26px 24px;}
  .gov h4{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;}
  .gov p{margin:0;font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .authority-note{
    margin-top:28px;padding:20px 24px;border-left:2px solid var(--accent);
    background:var(--bg-soft);border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .authority-note b{color:var(--ink);}

  /* ---------- PARTNERS ---------- */
  .partners{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--rule);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;}
  @media (max-width:900px){ .partners{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);} }
  @media (max-width:520px){ .partners{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .partner{background:var(--bg-card);padding:24px 20px;}
  .partner .label{display:block;margin-bottom:10px;}
  .partner h4{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:1.02rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px;}
  .partner p{margin:0;font-size:0.84rem;color:var(--ink-soft);}

  /* ---------- TRUST ---------- */
  .trust{background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg);border-radius:14px;padding:clamp(32px,5vw,52px);}
  .trust .section-head h2{color:var(--bg);}
  .trust .section-head .label{color:var(--accent-dim);}
  .trustgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:28px 32px;}
  @media (max-width:860px){ .trustgrid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);} }
  @media (max-width:560px){ .trustgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .trust-item h4{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:0.98rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--bg);}
  .trust-item p{margin:0;font-size:0.86rem;color:rgba(10,14,20,0.68);}

  /* ---------- PATHWAY ---------- */
  .pathway{display:flex;align-items:stretch;gap:0;border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;}
  @media (max-width:760px){ .pathway{flex-direction:column;} }
  .pwstep{flex:1;background:var(--bg-card);padding:28px 26px;position:relative;}
  .pwstep .label{display:block;margin-bottom:10px;}
  .pwstep h4{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;}
  .pwstep p{margin:0;font-size:0.86rem;color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .pwarrow{flex:none;width:48px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--bg-raised);color:var(--ink-faint);}
  @media (max-width:760px){ .pwarrow{width:100%;height:32px;} .pwarrow svg{transform:rotate(90deg);} }

  /* ---------- IMPACT / ASK ---------- */
  .impact-split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;background:var(--rule);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;}
  @media (max-width:860px){ .impact-split{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .impact-col{background:var(--bg-card);padding:clamp(26px,3.4vw,38px);}
  .impact-col .label{display:block;margin-bottom:16px;}
  .impact-col ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;}
  .impact-col li{display:flex;gap:12px;font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--ink-soft);align-items:flex-start;}
  .impact-col .tick{flex:none;width:18px;height:18px;margin-top:2px;color:var(--verify);}
  .impact-col.ask .tick{color:var(--accent);}

  /* ---------- CTA ---------- */
  .cta{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--bg-raised),var(--bg-soft));
    border:1px solid var(--rule-strong);border-radius:14px;
    padding:clamp(36px,5vw,56px);
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 0.8fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;
  }
  @media (max-width:760px){ .cta{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .cta h2{font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3vw,2.2rem);margin-bottom:14px;}
  .cta p{color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:44ch;}
  .cta-contact{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;font-size:0.92rem;}
  .cta-contact .label{margin-bottom:4px;}
  .cta-contact a{text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);transition:color .15s ease;}
  .cta-contact a:hover{color:var(--accent);}
  .cta-contact .partner-line{margin-top:10px;font-size:0.82rem;color:var(--ink-faint);}

  /* ---------- FOOTER ---------- */
  footer{border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding:46px 0 36px;}
  footer .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  footer .label{display:block;margin-bottom:10px;}
  footer p{margin:0;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:40ch;}
  .foot-links{display:flex;gap:28px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .foot-links a{font-size:0.85rem;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .foot-links a:hover{color:var(--accent);}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="brandmark">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <path d="M16 6L25 12V20L16 26L7 20V12L16 6Z" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <path d="M16 14L20.5 16.5V21.5L16 24L11.5 21.5V16.5L16 14Z" fill="var(--verify)"/>
      </svg>
      Minerals<span class="ready">Ready</span>
    </div>
    <div class="navlinks">
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#platform">Platform</a></li>
        <li><a href="#curriculum">Curriculum</a></li>
        <li><a href="#how">How it works</a></li>
        <li><a href="#governance">Governance</a></li>
        <li><a href="#trust">Trust</a></li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn-solid" href="#contact">Partner with us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <div class="hero-eyebrow"><span class="rule"></span><span class="label">Minerals Compliance &amp; Training Platform · MCTP</span></div>
      <h1>Compliance travels.<br>Capacity now <span class="accentword">travels with it.</span></h1>
      <p class="lede">MineralsReady is a government-led digital public service for responsible artisanal and small-scale mining: one governed platform, a field app for miners, traders and site holders, and a live dashboard for the regulators who oversee them.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a class="btn btn-solid" href="#platform">See the platform</a>
        <a class="btn" href="#contact">Start a scoping conversation</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-note">The platform supports statutory authority with better data and clearer records. It does not replace it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 400 340" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none">
        <rect x="18" y="30" width="150" height="280" rx="18" fill="var(--bg-card)" stroke="var(--rule-strong)" stroke-width="1.2"/>
        <rect x="34" y="56" width="118" height="10" rx="2" fill="var(--bg-soft)"/>
        <rect x="34" y="76" width="80" height="7" rx="2" fill="var(--bg-soft)"/>
        <g stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.3">
          <rect x="34" y="100" width="118" height="46" rx="6" fill="none" opacity="0.8"/>
          <path d="M44 123L50 129L62 113" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </g>
        <rect x="34" y="158" width="118" height="46" rx="6" fill="none" stroke="var(--rule-strong)" stroke-width="1.2"/>
        <rect x="44" y="172" width="70" height="6" rx="2" fill="var(--bg-soft)"/>
        <rect x="44" y="184" width="50" height="6" rx="2" fill="var(--bg-soft)"/>
        <rect x="34" y="216" width="118" height="46" rx="6" fill="none" stroke="var(--rule-strong)" stroke-width="1.2"/>
        <circle cx="52" cy="239" r="8" fill="none" stroke="var(--verify)" stroke-width="1.3"/>
        <path d="M48 239L51 242L57 235" stroke="var(--verify)" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        <rect x="68" y="233" width="68" height="6" rx="2" fill="var(--bg-soft)"/>
        <rect x="200" y="86" width="182" height="134" rx="14" fill="var(--bg-card)" stroke="var(--rule-strong)" stroke-width="1.2"/>
        <rect x="216" y="100" width="90" height="9" rx="2" fill="var(--bg-soft)"/>
        <circle cx="356" cy="105" r="5" fill="var(--verify)" opacity="0.8"/>
        <g stroke="var(--verify)" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.9">
          <rect x="216" y="124" width="150" height="70" rx="6" fill="none"/>
          <path d="M226 180L246 158L264 168L288 138L312 164L334 148L356 160" fill="none"/>
        </g>
        <rect x="226" y="184" width="26" height="6" rx="1.5" fill="var(--accent)" opacity="0.7"/>
        <rect x="258" y="184" width="26" height="6" rx="1.5" fill="var(--verify)" opacity="0.5"/>
        <path d="M168 150C182 150 186 150 200 150" stroke="var(--rule-strong)" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-dasharray="4 5"/>
        <circle cx="184" cy="150" r="5" fill="var(--bg)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.3"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="ledger">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="ledger-item">
      <div class="num">45M</div>
      <p>People directly employed in artisanal &amp; small-scale mining worldwide</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ledger-item">
      <div class="num">80+</div>
      <p>Countries where ASM is a leading rural, non-farm employer</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ledger-item">
      <div class="num">8</div>
      <p>Module families covering safety, environment, geology and compliance</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ledger-item">
      <div class="num">12mo</div>
      <p>From inception to institutional handover, local team to local team</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="platform">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>One platform,<br>two connected surfaces.</h2>
      <span class="label">The platform in one view</span>
    </div>
    <p class="section-intro">A mobile app for the field and a dashboard for the regulator, sharing one governed content base. What a miner completes, a regulator can see; what a regulator approves, a miner can act on.</p>
    <div class="surfaces">
      <div class="surface app">
        <span class="label">MineralsReady app</span>
        <h3>For the field</h3>
        <p>For miners, site holders, traders, graders and trainees, built offline-first for remote sites.</p>
        <ul class="featlist">
          <li><svg class="tick" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M4 10.5L8 14.5L16 5.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span><b>Learn</b> — short offline-first modules in plain language</span></li>
          <li><svg class="tick" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M4 10.5L8 14.5L16 5.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span><b>Verify</b> — assessments with regulator-defined pass thresholds</span></li>
          <li><svg class="tick" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M4 10.5L8 14.5L16 5.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span><b>Improve</b> — checklists, SOPs and reporting templates</span></li>
          <li><svg class="tick" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M4 10.5L8 14.5L16 5.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span><b>Self-Report</b> — upload documents, photos and site records</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="surface dash">
        <span class="label">Government dashboard</span>
        <h3>For the regulator</h3>
        <p>For ministries, agencies, inspectors and district offices, built for oversight at scale.</p>
        <ul class="featlist">
          <li><svg class="tick" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M4 10.5L8 14.5L16 5.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span><b>Set standards</b> — approve modules and compliance criteria</span></li>
          <li><svg class="tick" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M4 10.5L8 14.5L16 5.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span><b>Review &amp; verify</b> — completion records and submitted evidence</span></li>
          <li><svg class="tick" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M4 10.5L8 14.5L16 5.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span><b>Monitor &amp; prioritise</b> — a risk-based view of site readiness</span></li>
          <li><svg class="tick" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M4 10.5L8 14.5L16 5.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span><b>Strengthen oversight</b> — auditable records, fewer bottlenecks</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="seam-note">Licence readiness means a licence confirms more than submitted forms and fees — it confirms that the applicant has completed country-specific learning and passed a regulator-approved assessment. The government remains the sole issuer of licences throughout.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="alt" id="why">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Compliance travels.<br>Capacity does not.</h2>
      <span class="label">Why this, why now</span>
    </div>
    <p class="section-intro">Standards arrive at the mine face as paperwork addressed to those least equipped to satisfy it. Six gaps explain why, and each maps to a function the platform performs.</p>
    <div class="reasons">
      <div class="reason">
        <span class="idx">01</span>
        <h4>Scattered rules</h4>
        <p>Guidance sits across institutions and documents, hard to read and apply on site.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="reason">
        <span class="idx">02</span>
        <h4>Thin training access</h4>
        <p>Miners, traders and small operators rarely reach formal, practical training.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="reason">
        <span class="idx">03</span>
        <h4>Persistent risk</h4>
        <p>Safety and environmental hazards stay high where upskilling is inconsistent.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="reason">
        <span class="idx">04</span>
        <h4>Stretched regulators</h4>
        <p>Agencies lack tools to verify readiness at scale or monitor remote activity.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="reason">
        <span class="idx">05</span>
        <h4>Credibility gap</h4>
        <p>Buyers and partners increasingly expect official, verifiable compliance signals.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="reason">
        <span class="idx">06</span>
        <h4>A readiness gap</h4>
        <p>The constraint is not unwillingness, it is a reachable route to proving practice.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

