<section id="trust">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="trust">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Minimal data,<br>maximum trust.</h2>
        <span class="label">Data, privacy &amp; sovereignty</span>
      </div>
      <div class="trustgrid">
        <div class="trust-item"><h4>Data minimisation</h4><p>Only what is needed for training completion and licence readiness is collected.</p></div>
        <div class="trust-item"><h4>Clear purpose</h4><p>Data serves training, documentation and regulatory processes defined by national policy.</p></div>
        <div class="trust-item"><h4>Defined access</h4><p>Learners, trainers and regulators hold role-based access to relevant information only.</p></div>
        <div class="trust-item"><h4>No personal surveillance</h4><p>The platform documents readiness; it is not designed for personal tracking.</p></div>
        <div class="trust-item"><h4>Secure storage</h4><p>Stored and retained under national data-protection and regulatory requirements.</p></div>
        <div class="trust-item"><h4>National sovereignty</h4><p>Hosting and ownership arrangements confirmed with government before deployment.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

